<item><title><![CDATA[Have you heard of human echolocation?]]></title><description><![CDATA[This guest post is for you if you've ever thought about people honing their senses to perfection. Also for fans of Marvel&#8217;s Daredevil character, but that&#8217;s a given!]]></description><link>https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-human-echolocation</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-human-echolocation</guid><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 05:41:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587573578274-184d5ccabfc3?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw0N3x8ZWNob2xvY2F0aW9ufGVufDB8fHx8MTc4ODgxMzEwMXww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><em>This post is written in Spanish on purpose. You don&#8217;t need to understand every word; just keep reading.</em></p><p>En el cap&#237;tulo de hoy de comprensi&#243;n lectora (o secci&#243;n &#8220;&#161;&#161;&#161;&#191;Pero qu&#233;?!!!&#8221; para los amigos), vamos a hablar de la ecolocalizaci&#243;n.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587573578274-184d5ccabfc3?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw0N3x8ZWNob2xvY2F0aW9ufGVufDB8fHx8MTc4ODgxMzEwMXww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587573578274-184d5ccabfc3?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw0N3x8ZWNob2xvY2F0aW9ufGVufDB8fHx8MTc4ODgxMzEwMXww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 424w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587573578274-184d5ccabfc3?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw